.\" Template: linux/build-deb.sh fills in @VERSION@ and @DATE@.
.TH FINSICAL 6 "@DATE@" "Finsical @VERSION@" "Games Manual"
.SH NAME
finsical \- retro virtual aquarium
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B finsical
.RB [ \-\-smoke\-test ]
.br
.B finsical
.BR \-\-version " | " \-\-help
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B finsical
shows little pixel fish in a floating window shaped like a vintage
computer, in the spirit of the 90s Mac classic AquaZone.
Click above the waterline to feed the fish, or in the water to tap the
glass.
Drag the computer case, or the top edge of the window, to move it.
.PP
Right-click the tank, or any Finsical window, for the app menu.
Starting
.B finsical
again while it runs brings the tank to the front.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-smoke\-test
Start on a throwaway profile, check that the tank, its windows, the
messages between them and a menu action work, then quit.
The exit status is 0 when every check passes.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print a usage summary and exit.
.SH KEYS
.TP
.B Ctrl+O
Tank Overview
.TP
.B Ctrl+Shift+S
Tank Stats
.TP
.B Ctrl+I
Import Add-ons
.TP
.B Ctrl+,
Preferences
.TP
.B Ctrl+F
Feed Fish
.TP
.B Ctrl+R
CRT Effect
.TP
.B Ctrl+L
Lamp On
.TP
.B Ctrl+Alt+S
Mute Sound
.TP
.B Ctrl+P
Pause or resume the simulation
.TP
.BR Ctrl+= ", " Ctrl++
Make the tank larger
.TP
.B Ctrl+\-
Make the tank smaller
.TP
.B Ctrl+W
Close the focused Finsical window (not the tank)
.TP
.B F1
Finsical Help
.TP
.B Ctrl+Q
Quit Finsical
.PP
With the tank focused, the bare keys F, C, L, M and P feed the fish and
toggle the CRT effect, the lamp, the sound and the simulation.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B FINSICAL_WEB_ROOT
Serve the web app from this directory (the output of
.BR "npm run build" )
instead of
.IR /usr/share/finsical/web .
.TP
.B GDK_BACKEND
Finsical prefers X11 (XWayland on a Wayland desktop), where it can keep
the tank above other windows, on every desktop and where you left it.
Set
.B GDK_BACKEND=wayland
to run as a native Wayland client without those features.
.SH FILES
The directories follow the XDG base directory variables; the defaults
are shown.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/finsical/
The tank, its fish, settings and imported add-ons (web storage).
.TP
.I ~/.cache/finsical/
Web caches.
.TP
.I ~/.config/finsical/windows.json
Window sizes and positions.
.TP
.I ~/.config/finsical/settings.json
Float Above Other Windows and Show on All Desktops.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on a normal quit or a passing smoke test; 1 when Finsical cannot
start (no display, missing libraries or web app) or a smoke test check
fails.
.SH BUGS
Report bugs at https://github.com/L\-K\-M/Finsical/issues
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/L\-K\-M/Finsical
